The zugeo package bundles the geoarrow-c library, the ryu printer it ships
with, and the Apache Arrow nanoarrow core. zugeo is distributed under the
MIT license. geoarrow-c and nanoarrow are distributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; ryu under the Apache License, Version 2.0 or the
Boost Software License, Version 1.0. The licences apply to their respective
files; the package as a whole is not MIT-licensed. inst/COPYRIGHTS lists
each directory and its notice.
